    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T11:40:05Z",
    "body": "Another case of duplicate work, for this guard: two reviewers independently reviewed PR #3689 at head `cd2febfdf` - ours `6021010806` (11:38:23Z) and the other session's `6020974233` (11:35:26Z), both marked, both `merge-ready`, and the other session merged it as `3fc0e017b`. The guard should cover \"who reviews a PR\" as well as \"who pushes to a branch\": a PR-level owner record, read before a review is dispatched.\n",
