    "body": "Process case for this guard: another session merged main into PR #3549 (author paulsvc) and pushed a head that did not compile (duplicated closers at `crates/app/src/operation/types/avoid.rs:77` - `cargo check` failed with \"unexpected closing delimiter\"). A merge was pushed without a compile check. Suggested rule for the ownership/refresh guard: a refresh push must include a compile check (`cargo check` at least), not only a clean merge.\n",
